  "rationale": "The plant automata G model the robot's perception (obstacle and marker detection) and motion primitives. The specification automata E bind sensor outcomes to safe and goal-directed actions, enforcing safety, marker approach, and recovery policies. The design ensures determinism, single controllable per state, and correct handling of uncontrollables. Helper states are used for commit, scan, recovery, and marker tracking. Terminal goal state is reached only on marker_close.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception (obstacle/marker) and motion commands.",
